## Third-party components

MatterHelm links open-source components (matter.js, zod, pino in `bridge/`;
QRCoder in `app/`). See `bridge/package.json` / `app/MatterHelm/MatterHelm.csproj`
for the current pinned versions and their own licenses; none are bundled or
modified in this repository.
